I9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3vhc909xqApk-pFSNSfWQA","review_id":"Co8tCzWralJD6Tv3luyKdQ","date":"2015-11-12T11:54:32","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9533358812332153,"text_excerpt":"NOLA has tons of hot sauce stores, this one is probably the most well-organized and professional looking of them all. Prices are a bit higher for similar products that we found in other stores, but it is the Official Tabasco Store so there you go. I got some earrings shaped like bottles of tabasco which are awesome, and I enjoyed some of the samples up by the register. The garlic tabasco is my absolute favorite, had to buy a bottle! We also got a really cool spoon rest shaped like a tabasco bottle. Great place to stop in and shop for souvenirs near Jackson Square."},{"business_id":"3vhc909xqApk-pFSNSfWQA","review_id":"0Oxgdt56vlg29r1IoJbFrw","date":"2010-10-28T21:03:57","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9413071274757385,"text_excerpt":"I just about always stop into this store for something every time I'm in New Orleans. They have all the usual Tabasco stuff but with some different things as well... On this trip I picked up Garlic Flavored Tabasco as well as a Tabasco Chili Starter. Other favorites of mine are the Tabasco Ketchup and the Tabasco Mayo. They also have some fun gift items such as Tabasco themed Christmas ornaments and kitchenware. The shop girls also bubble wrap your glass items at no additional cost."},{"business_id":"3vhc909xqApk-pFSNSfWQA","review_id":"hLehvEEH8WX4i2fDWXlAKQ","date":"2015-12-21T21:32:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9398197531700134,"text_excerpt":"I was so thrilled to visit this store, Tabasco is one of the best hot sauces. The merchandise is fun, the staff is awesome. Make sure you try the different sauces in the front. I was disappointed that they didn't have the reserve in stock, but I will definitely be ordering from their website. I love the ketchup and the steak sauce I bought. I will make this a stop everytime I'm in nola"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3vhc909xqApk-pFSNSfWQA","photo_id":"nU-ylCvVQJlj2u82ZfsVGA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/nU-ylCvVQJlj2u82ZfsVGA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9056204557418823},{"business_id":"3vhc909xqApk-pFSNSfWQA","photo_id":"nNp79yRXP09yqJVQ3WckcA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/nNp79yRXP09yqJVQ3WckcA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8276574611663818},{"business_id":"3vhc909xqApk-pFSNSfWQA","photo_id":"q2Ky5ZYOisgcGrcIys_Jjg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/q2Ky5ZYOisgcGrcIys_Jjg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7042055130004883}]},"notebook_case":null}
